 "poem": "The current world with wonder\nBasks in the reflected debris.\nWe have discovered things unknown,\nAnd left our earthly,\nThere's life to see and feel anew, and\nWith all its delight out of inspiration.\nAll that you know has been lost again,\nAnd we may still be glad of everyone.\nBut let your mind no fewer\nHave the tears for revelation.\nFrom the depths of darkness I expect\nTo find a new observation.",
